{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39239","headline":"婺州和陆谏议将赴阙怀阳羡山居 · 韦庄","name":"婺州和陆谏议将赴阙怀阳羡山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望阙路仍远，子牟魂欲飞。\n道开烧药鼎，僧寄卧云衣。\n故国饶芳草，他山挂夕晖。\n东阳虽胜地，王粲奈思归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}